   547	      'cross_host_review: a review-only dispatch policy is required to spawn the codex review subprocess; '
   548	      + 'refusing to run an unconstrained subprocess (fail-closed). Pass --policy=<name> or an inline policy '
   549	      + 'that grants allowReviewOnlyRealHostSubprocess for a codex host.',
   550	    );
