   564	      `cross_host_review: dispatch policy "${authorized.policy}" does not grant a read-only codex reviewer `
   565	      + '(requires allowReviewOnlyRealHostSubprocess=true AND codex in allowedHosts); '
   566	      + 'refusing to spawn the codex review subprocess (fail-closed).',
   567	    );
   568	  }
